  "body": "Step into this beautifully designed freestanding home, where generous proportions meet contemporary style and everyday functionality. Boasting an approximate floor area of 152m² (more or less), this impressive home features a thoughtfully designed layout perfectly suited to modern family living.\r\n\r\n4 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | 1 guest toilet | Approx. 152m² Floor Area | 169m²(MOL) Freehold Land | Internal single garage | Fully Fenced\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n• Freehold & Freestanding – A stylish two level home complete with a single internal-access garage.\r\n• Generous 152m² Floor Area (approx.) – Thoughtfully designed to provide spacious, comfortable, and practical family living.\r\n• Four Bedrooms Upstairs – All four well-appointed bedrooms are positioned on the upper level, including a generous master suite with its own ensuite.\r\n• Modern & Functional Kitchen – Featuring quality appliances, ample storage, and a practical layout designed to make everyday cooking and entertaining effortless.\r\n• Separate Dining & Living Areas – Offering excellent flexibility for modern family life, with both spaces enjoying seamless access to the outdoor area and garden, perfect for entertaining, relaxing, and easy indoor-outdoor living.\r\n• Sun-Soaked Outdoor Living – Step out onto the sunny deck, perfectly positioned for entertaining family and friends or simply unwinding outdoors. The fully fenced, low maintenance backyard provides a safe and secure space for children and pets to enjoy.\r\n\r\nZoned for Top Schools:\r\n• Pigeon Mountain School\r\n• Bucklands Beach Intermediate\r\n• Macleans College\r\n \r\nUnbeatable Location:\r\n\r\nLocated in the prestigious Half Moon Bay, you’ll enjoy a vibrant coastal lifestyle close to the stunning Half Moon Bay Marina. A short drive connects you to a wide selection of cafés, restaurants, shops, and ferry services to the Auckland CBD. Whether it's sailing at the local yacht club or enjoying the scenic waterfront, this location truly offers convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\n \r\nDon’t miss your chance to move into one of East Auckland’s most desirable suburbs — with top-tier education & coastal living, Call now to book a private viewing or visit us at the next open home. You won’t be disappointed!\r\n\r\n\r\nNote: While care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, no responsibility is accepted for the accuracy of the whole or any part thereof and interested persons are advised to make their own enquiries and satisfy themselves in all respects.",
